Phase 4 (Point-in-Time & Temporal Truth Engine) is complete. Final state:
- Temporal classification of every record (event/publication/effective/ingestion, vintage id+date) via src/orbit/temporal/adapters.py; canonical timing frames feed rules, engine, snapshot, features.
- Strict availability: publication_time < as_of (exact tie rejected); date-precision → next day 00:00 UTC; market bars at session close 16:00 America/New_York → UTC (never ts_utc); missing publication never invented; event after as_of rejected; revised macro without ALFRED vintages rejected + reported as limitation (DFF non_revised).
- Vintage resolution keeps the latest version released before as_of per (series, observation); superseded versions audited as VINTAGE_SUPERSEDED in the snapshot's excluded set, never dropped.
